cff-version: 1.3.0
message: "Si usás FARO en tu investigación, citalo así. / If you use FARO in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "FARO: Fichero Analítico de Registro y Observación"
abstract: >-
  FARO is a free, browser-based tool for qualitative and ethnographic research.
  It supports coding field notes, interviews and documents, thick description,
  code networks, citation management and bibliography recommendation with explicit
  North–South, gender and linguistic balance. The browser extension lets researchers
  code directly in Google Docs (codes are stored inside the document as named ranges),
  capture and code web content for digital ethnography, and compute inter-coder
  agreement (Cohen's kappa and Krippendorff's alpha).
type: software
